ility:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7c9ffea4-8e7f-4d91-a7db-4f9a6f0b6a42)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2938916652/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2939080105","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107099#issuecomment-2939080105","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107099","id":2939080105,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6vLs2p","user":{"login":"Kaleb-Reid","id":78945904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4OTQ1OTA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78945904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid","html_url":"https://github.com/Kaleb-Reid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-04T08:20:26Z","updated_at":"2025-06-04T08:31:58Z","body":"I think I fixed the compatibility implementation, the color for the sky lights was also missing a conversion from sRGB color space to linear.\r\n\r\nthis pr now on compatibility:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9f5f1fc4-03b5-467c-97ba-33f6f6f93d82)","aut